    },
    "This device's own log of licence changes sent to WorkTrack (worktrack-actions.json, never deleted). WorkTrack keeps its own audit trail as well.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fa-AF": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "دفتر همین دستگاه از تغییرات لایسنس که به WorkTrack فرستاده شده (worktrack-actions.json، هرگز پاک نمی‌شود). WorkTrack هم دفتر بازرسی خودش را دارد."
